[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8826.389, "timestamp": "02:27:06", "text": "成功。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8828.23, "timestamp": "02:27:08", "text": "哦，是的。说到先生，我仍然觉得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8832.79, "timestamp": "02:27:12", "text": "真没想到你会这么说。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8836.51, "timestamp": "02:27:16", "text": "我当时就问：“你还在用这个吗？”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8840.07, "timestamp": "02:27:20", "text": "“账户？”她回答说：“是的。”然后我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8843.99, "timestamp": "02:27:23", "text": "当时的意思是，“哦，如果你有空的话……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8846.309, "timestamp": "02:27:26", "text": "我正在做这个叫Joathon的事情。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8849.19, "timestamp": "02:27:29", "text": "邀请了我遇到的所有人，以及所有与我联系过的人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8851.349, "timestamp": "02:27:31", "text": "一路陪伴着我。你愿意吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8853.91, "timestamp": "02:27:33", "text": "就像露面之类的？”她就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8855.67, "timestamp": "02:27:35", "text": "例如，“是的，我很乐意。”和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8858.15, "timestamp": "02:27:38", "text": "一切。这就是我能够……的原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8861.19, "timestamp": "02:27:41", "text": "抓住她。我没想到自己能达到100%。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8869.429, "timestamp": "02:27:49", "text": "我的意思是，我确实看到了她的不满，你知道的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8871.91, "timestamp": "02:27:51", "text": "在网上出现，但就像偶像一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8874.87, "timestamp": "02:27:54", "text": "呃，事情而不是完全但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8878.11, "timestamp": "02:27:58", "text": "是啊，从来没有"}]